d` terminal blocker row; 0 rows are student-display eligible.\n\nCloses #1256\nParent: #1243\nDepends on: #1255\n\n## Boundary\n- Fresh #1256 authorization comment was verified before live provider execution.\n- Raw VLM output is not stored in runtime student-display paths; artifacts retain request/response ids, hashes, provider/model metadata, timestamps, schema validation, and candidate-only bbox proposals.\n- VLM candidates do not set rights/display approval, SourceVisualReceipt approval, visual QA acceptance, Method Map truth, or scoring authority.\n\n## Counts\n- Scheduled rows processed: 833\n- External VLM calls: 833\n- Candidate-only rows: 832\n- Terminal blocker rows: 1 (`schema_validation_failed`, invalid bbox width/height)\n- Wave validators: 34/34 pass\n- `student_display_eligible_final: true`: 0\n\n## Verification\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-vlm-bulk-execution.test.js`\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-vlm-wave1-execution.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-vlm-crop-proposal-harness.test.js scripts/method-map/__tests__/figureasset-bulk-crop-wave-scheduler.test.js`\n- `node scripts/method-map/run-figureasset-vlm-bulk-crop-proposals.mjs --dry-run --render-missing --max-waves 1`\n- Aggregate artifact check: 34 waves, 833 selected rows, 833 calls, 832 candidates, 1 terminal row, 0 display-eligible rows, 0 validator failures.\n- `git diff --cached --check`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`\n","created_at":"2026-07-04T16:28:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-04T16:31:28Z","closed_at":"2026-07-04T16:30:58Z","merged_at":"2026-07-04T16:30:58Z","merge_commit_sha":"3abab70ee70f6b636b3b5b30b550d1818515f314","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1273/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github